tornado-sparkline
================

Vendored source — license-mirror attribution
----------------------------------------------

This crate carries a verbatim mirror of the public `Sparkline` +
`SparklineBar` widget source code from the `ratatui` project, version
`ratatui-v0.30.0`, located at:

  https://github.com/ratatui/ratatui/blob/ratatui-v0.30.0/src/widgets/sparkline.rs

